`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"Two years ago, right before I flew out to visit friends in Australia and Malaysia, I remember sitting in a cafe, thinking: what gift do I bring?"}),`
`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"I wanted to take a touch of Nepal but not a cliché option. But I overthought every option, and at the last minute, just grabbed pashmina shawls."}),`
`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"For an Australian summer!"}),`
`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"Ugh, sorry Cath."}),`
