`,o.jsx(t.p,{children:"Since that trip, every time I wander around Kathmandu, I notice things that instantly strike me as perfect souvenir gifts. Exactly the kind I wish I'd found back when I was stressing over what to buy. So instead of letting that knowledge sit uselessly in my head, here's my running list of the best gifts from Nepal. Most of them come from small Nepali brands that deserve far more attention than they get."}),`
